Modifications from upstream:
- Rebranding: import package `dev`, CLIs `dev` / `dev-serve` / `dev-mcp-server`,
  environment variables `DEV_*`, TypeScript package `dev-ts`.
- Security hardening: loopback-only server default with a warning on
  unauthenticated non-loopback bindings, redacted MCP internal-error details,
  path-traversal containment for model subfolders, bounded regex/BPE work on
  untrusted text, reserved-key rejection (prototype-pollution defense),
  HTTPS-only and size-capped model downloads in the TypeScript SDK,
  weights_only (non-pickle) checkpoint export, pinned CI action SHAs, and a
  security policy (SECURITY.md).

See the git history for the full change set.
